WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
video file and English subs: Safex

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:07.863
Candy came to the Adleys in Chicago.

00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:12.674
Here, she encountered Neil
and his sister Eliza.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:16.803
And then, she visited Grand Aunt Elroy
who she hadn't seen for a while.

00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:21.717
Grand Aunt Elroy was, as expected,
not very friendly to Candy.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:26.758
The cabin of old memories.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.591
Candy, let's stay in this place tonight,

00:00:33.741 --> 00:00:35.525
and we can chat all night!

00:00:35.675 --> 00:00:39.798
I found a good place for us.
Everyone, you will be excited about it.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.267
Everyone?
Including Patty?

00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:46.509
Archie, what did you say?

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.737
Patty is coming?

00:00:47.987 --> 00:00:50.278
Tell her, brother.

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.708
Patty wrote to us
in the middle of this month.

00:00:53.858 --> 00:00:56.583
France is in critical condition
since the war started.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:01.016
It's just a matter of time for England
to join the war.

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:03.487
Although Patty is safe in London so far,

00:01:03.637 --> 00:01:05.928
she will be involved sooner or later.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:10.009
I hope she can come to America
as soon as possible.

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:14.265
I saw Brother's face when reading
the letter, Candy.

00:01:14.315 --> 00:01:16.567
- Archie
- Come, Annie, Candy!

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.179
This way!

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:29.746
It's here.

00:01:29.896 --> 00:01:31.114
What place is this?

00:01:31.264 --> 00:01:32.616
Take your time to look around.

00:01:32.766 --> 00:01:35.248
Stear, Archie!

00:01:35.398 --> 00:01:37.088
The main gate is not that way.

00:01:37.238 --> 00:01:39.131
The main gate? What do you mean?

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.030
Isn't Candy leaving?

00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:47.302
No, Candy is leaving tomorrow.

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.930
They are spending a night here,
getting good rest.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.702
Shouldn't you be leaving?

00:01:53.952 --> 00:01:56.440
Who wants to leave?

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:58.976
We are staying over tonight!
Right, Brother?

00:01:59.126 --> 00:02:00.009
Sure!

00:02:00.159 --> 00:02:04.618
Stear and Archie,
take them out of here right now!

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:07.002
I don't want them near me!

00:02:07.194 --> 00:02:09.553
Neil, shut up!

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.286
Don't be rude to the ladies!

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.520
I know.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:15.827
But these two are not ladies.

00:02:16.007 --> 00:02:18.825
They are orphans from Pony's Home.

00:02:19.075 --> 00:02:22.796
Bastard! Let's fight!

00:02:22.946 --> 00:02:27.333
No, Archie, please!

00:02:27.483 --> 00:02:30.610
She is right, it's a waste of time.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:34.644
Don't waste our time.
Right, Archie?

00:02:34.794 --> 00:02:36.119
Let's go!

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:39.182
Annie, don't let her bother you.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.160
Come, let's go!

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:45.321
I can't believe she dared to come back.

00:02:45.471 --> 00:02:47.690
Candy is a big mouth, it's annoying.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.699
- Right, Brother?
- Right.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.166
These two have to go.

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:02.272
What a broad grassland!

00:03:02.422 --> 00:03:05.308
We have a horse-riding field, too!

00:03:05.558 --> 00:03:06.908
It's great!

00:03:07.058 --> 00:03:09.011
Look at that big tree!

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.621
That is the good place
I was talking about.

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:15.117
Isn't it great, Annie? Let's go!

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.558
Candy, we haven't been running
together for a long time.

00:03:19.733 --> 00:03:22.601
It feels so good!

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.496
- Can I climb up?
- Sure.

00:03:30.646 --> 00:03:32.139
Good!

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:37.378
Amazing!
Candy never ceases to amaze us!

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:40.912
I am coming.

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:44.214
Annie, it's your turn.

00:03:44.364 --> 00:03:45.716
Me too?

00:03:45.866 --> 00:03:48.119
Candy, put down the rope ladder.

00:03:48.269 --> 00:03:49.522
Ok!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.024
Annie, hurry! It's so beautiful here!

00:03:54.174 --> 00:03:56.493
Don't be afraid.

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:03.639
Come on.

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:05.836
Thank you, Stear.

00:04:05.986 --> 00:04:07.913
Annie, isn't it great?

00:04:08.982 --> 00:04:11.207
This looks like a door in Lilliput.

00:04:11.357 --> 00:04:13.174
Can I enter?

00:04:13.324 --> 00:04:14.574
Sure.

00:04:14.724 --> 00:04:15.886
Annie, come along.

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:29.196
This was built by Uncle Marian
when I was little.

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:32.797
Kids who caused any trouble
would hide here.

00:04:32.947 --> 00:04:36.307
Especially Anthony.
He loved to hide here.

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.138
That's ok, Stear.

00:04:42.288 --> 00:04:44.716
Anthony must have been very cute
when he was a kid.

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:45.973
Very cute.

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:50.145
Brother,
I was cuter than Anthony, right?

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:52.315
That's not true, Archie.

00:04:52.465 --> 00:04:56.551
I am the cutest,
when I'm not wearing my glasses.

00:04:56.701 --> 00:04:57.960
Look!

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:01.559
You can't go back to childhood,
even if you take off your glasses.

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:04.595
Everyone is cute when is little.

00:05:04.745 --> 00:05:07.229
We were too. Right, Annie?

00:05:27.193 --> 00:05:29.252
Candy, why are you smiling?

00:05:30.229 --> 00:05:33.123
I am imagining how you looked like
when you were little.

00:05:33.273 --> 00:05:36.188
You are as silly as Candy.

00:05:36.338 --> 00:05:37.564
True.

00:05:46.646 --> 00:05:49.506
What are you laughing about, Annie?

00:05:49.656 --> 00:05:52.282
Candy was really a silly child.

00:05:52.419 --> 00:05:54.414
She still is.

00:05:55.555 --> 00:05:57.989
Archie, I hate you!

00:05:58.991 --> 00:06:01.217
But the house is smaller.

00:06:01.367 --> 00:06:05.090
That's because we are bigger now.

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:06.854
That must be it.

00:06:07.004 --> 00:06:09.601
Look, the shoes we used to wear!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.829
- They are so cute!
- They are worn out.

00:06:13.106 --> 00:06:15.631
You were too naughty, that's why.

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:21.877
Come here!

00:06:26.753 --> 00:06:28.717
Hello, Mrs. Bird.

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:32.682
She likes us.

00:06:38.398 --> 00:06:40.093
It's so peaceful here!

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:43.734
Doesn't feel like war at all.

00:06:43.936 --> 00:06:45.061
Cool wind blowing

00:06:45.211 --> 00:06:47.005
in a clear sky,

00:06:47.245 --> 00:06:49.134
with birds singing.

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:52.169
How long can this last?

00:06:52.319 --> 00:06:54.212
It will definitely last.

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:58.480
Right, but things are hard to predict.

00:06:59.519 --> 00:07:04.616
Young people in England are joining the war.

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:19.935
To protect their country.

00:07:20.173 --> 00:07:21.734
We should do the same.

00:07:22.475 --> 00:07:24.667
Willing to sacrifice for peace.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.769
Sooner or later, we...

00:07:28.919 --> 00:07:30.840
Stop it!

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.752
Stop talking about the war!

00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:36.643
Sorry, Annie.

00:07:36.793 --> 00:07:38.724
Brother was just expressing
his feelings.

00:07:43.896 --> 00:07:47.525
Stear and Archie are worried
about the war too.

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:52.397
America is about to be involved.

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:59.434
It's true
that we might become the war nurses.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.509
Quiet!

00:08:05.659 --> 00:08:07.851
There are no nationalities
when it comes to medical treatment!

00:08:10.923 --> 00:08:14.290
Care giving should be fairly
provided to everyone!

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:18.789
It has nothing to do
with country or race!

00:08:18.939 --> 00:08:21.389
Everyone is equal!

00:08:25.438 --> 00:08:28.100
I can be recruited anytime.

00:08:28.407 --> 00:08:31.570
I want to cherish every moment.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:41.380
Don't think too much, cheer up!

00:08:42.889 --> 00:08:43.878
You are right.

00:08:44.824 --> 00:08:46.215
Watch me!

00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:54.087
Stear, are you alright?

00:08:54.237 --> 00:08:56.691
Brother, are you out of your mind?

00:08:57.637 --> 00:08:59.929
Come on, don't just stay there.

00:09:00.079 --> 00:09:01.165
Let's race!

00:09:01.315 --> 00:09:03.906
- Race?
- Ok! That's just what I was thinking.

00:09:07.113 --> 00:09:09.138
Ready? Go!

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:12.140
Candy, I'm right behind you!

00:09:12.285 --> 00:09:14.983
Annie, you run so fast!

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.158
Come on, Annie.

00:09:26.832 --> 00:09:29.426
You guys are good,
I can't keep up with you.

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:34.634
Candy hasn't changed.

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:37.631
Of course, I am from the north.

00:09:37.781 --> 00:09:39.142
You really are.

00:09:39.512 --> 00:09:42.136
Archie, take Candy and Annie
to their room.

00:09:42.286 --> 00:09:43.513
Ok.

00:09:44.684 --> 00:09:47.414
Here, this is your room.

00:09:48.955 --> 00:09:50.422
It's so pretty!

00:09:55.861 --> 00:09:59.785
Tonight, have a nice chat with Annie
about the old times.

00:09:59.935 --> 00:10:02.333
Thank you.

00:10:02.802 --> 00:10:05.100
See you later.

00:10:29.362 --> 00:10:30.687
What's wrong, Eliza?

00:10:30.837 --> 00:10:32.054
Archie and Stear...

00:10:32.204 --> 00:10:34.733
In what room they put them...
Do you know?

00:10:34.901 --> 00:10:37.429
In what room?

00:10:38.604 --> 00:10:40.436
The best room in the house!

00:10:42.174 --> 00:10:43.662
The best room?

00:10:43.812 --> 00:10:44.966
That's right.

00:10:45.116 --> 00:10:47.133
The arrogance!

00:10:47.283 --> 00:10:50.107
We should have different positions.
I am not allowing this!

00:10:50.316 --> 00:10:53.744
Brother, those two girls must go!

00:10:53.894 --> 00:10:55.218
Eliza, come in!

00:10:56.255 --> 00:10:58.883
Eliza, I have an idea!

00:10:59.659 --> 00:11:02.182
Let's irritate Candy
in front of Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:11:02.332 --> 00:11:03.919
So that Grand Aunt Elroy might get mad.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:06.191
But how?

00:11:06.365 --> 00:11:10.655
I have an idea!
Grand Aunt Elroy's favourite vase.

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:14.706
Get Candy to break the vase
in front of Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:11:20.446 --> 00:11:21.572
Come in!

00:11:23.682 --> 00:11:24.724
Eliza!

00:11:24.874 --> 00:11:27.441
How lucky that everybody is here!

00:11:27.591 --> 00:11:30.110
What can I do for you, Eliza?

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:32.820
Would you like to have some tea
together with me?

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.782
What's this all about?

00:11:35.932 --> 00:11:38.055
It's so boring to drink the tea
by myself.

00:11:38.205 --> 00:11:40.588
Please join me.

00:11:40.738 --> 00:11:42.390
Thank you, Eliza.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.626
Come on!

00:11:46.739 --> 00:11:48.531
She must be playing some trick.

00:11:48.781 --> 00:11:53.165
Come on, Stear, let's go!

00:11:53.315 --> 00:11:55.840
I hope she doesn't poison the tea.

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:07.187
Candy, you sit by the vase.

00:12:08.594 --> 00:12:11.049
I am going to pick up
Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:12:11.199 --> 00:12:12.396
Why?

00:12:12.932 --> 00:12:14.509
Grand Aunt Elroy is joining us?

00:12:14.609 --> 00:12:17.693
She often does things alone.

00:12:17.843 --> 00:12:19.433
We should have the tea with her.

00:12:21.073 --> 00:12:22.379
Sounds easy, but...

00:12:22.579 --> 00:12:27.403
Grand Aunt Elroy usually avoids us
and stays alone in her room.

00:12:27.553 --> 00:12:30.081
It's hard to believe
that she may accept our invitation.

00:12:33.786 --> 00:12:35.344
Grand Aunt Elroy!

00:12:39.458 --> 00:12:41.289
Come, Grand Aunt Elroy!

00:12:52.338 --> 00:12:53.396
I...

00:12:54.073 --> 00:12:55.631
Let me pour the tea for you.

00:13:00.413 --> 00:13:02.078
I...

00:13:06.385 --> 00:13:09.479
What is going on?
Eliza, in my room, immediately!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.550
Yes.

00:13:16.695 --> 00:13:19.521
Brother,
Grand Aunt Elroy was so mad at me.

00:13:19.799 --> 00:13:23.158
I am afraid
she may kick me out of here soon.

00:13:23.308 --> 00:13:26.266
How was I supposed to know that
Candy would stand up at that moment?

00:13:27.106 --> 00:13:30.166
It was an accident.
Let's think about something else.

00:13:30.943 --> 00:13:33.173
Brother, get the car!

00:13:34.013 --> 00:13:35.207
Hurry!

00:13:35.648 --> 00:13:37.115
Eliza, where are we going?

00:13:41.554 --> 00:13:43.518
I think I understand.

00:13:46.158 --> 00:13:47.716
We are here.

00:13:48.494 --> 00:13:50.018
Thank you, Neil.

00:13:51.664 --> 00:13:54.091
Let's go visit Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:13:54.241 --> 00:13:55.359
Yes, Mother.

00:13:55.509 --> 00:13:58.193
- Come in, please!
- Sorry to bother you.

00:13:59.505 --> 00:14:01.097
Welcome!

00:14:02.441 --> 00:14:06.068
Eliza broke the precious vase
by accident.

00:14:06.218 --> 00:14:08.471
I am very sorry.

00:14:08.621 --> 00:14:11.171
Candy suddenly stood up...

00:14:11.321 --> 00:14:13.717
The kid was careless.

00:14:14.987 --> 00:14:17.007
That kid is really a trouble.

00:14:17.197 --> 00:14:20.492
Grand Aunt Elroy,
why did you let her stay?

00:14:22.928 --> 00:14:24.652
I couldn't say anything.

00:14:24.802 --> 00:14:27.590
It was Grandfather William's decision.

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:30.333
She is still the Adleys' foster child.

00:14:30.903 --> 00:14:33.599
This is the Adleys' old house.

00:14:33.839 --> 00:14:35.131
She keeps coming here.

00:14:35.281 --> 00:14:39.300
What if gossip starts in the neighbourhood?
It will humiliate the Adleys.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:41.846
Annie is also an orphan of Pony's Home.

00:14:42.081 --> 00:14:45.374
An orphan of Pony's Home
going in and out the Adleys' house.

00:14:45.524 --> 00:14:46.958
What would people think about that?

00:14:47.186 --> 00:14:50.945
The Adleys will be ashamed,
if people find out about this.

00:14:51.357 --> 00:14:53.018
Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:14:54.026 --> 00:14:58.360
I am willing to take care of this...

00:14:59.732 --> 00:15:02.255
...for Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:15:02.405 --> 00:15:04.109
Please allow it. Good-bye.

00:15:17.016 --> 00:15:18.809
Candy, isn't it a pretty dress?

00:15:19.009 --> 00:15:20.610
It is!

00:15:21.487 --> 00:15:23.478
Archie gave it to me.

00:15:23.689 --> 00:15:25.379
- That's great!
- Candy

00:15:25.658 --> 00:15:26.791
Would you like to try it on?

00:15:27.009 --> 00:15:28.958
Me?

00:15:29.161 --> 00:15:32.155
No, thanks. I am not interested.

00:15:33.499 --> 00:15:38.132
Candy, it's ok for girls
to dress up once in a while.

00:15:38.304 --> 00:15:40.295
But I am a nurse...

00:15:40.445 --> 00:15:42.033
That's ok.

00:15:43.309 --> 00:15:44.901
Look, it fits you!

00:15:46.612 --> 00:15:48.807
Let's comb your hair a little bit.

00:15:54.853 --> 00:15:56.548
Don't move.

00:15:59.858 --> 00:16:01.485
Come here.

00:16:10.102 --> 00:16:13.431
So beautiful!
You are indeed a pretty woman.

00:16:14.273 --> 00:16:17.129
It doesn't look like me at all.
I'm embarrassed.

00:16:17.279 --> 00:16:20.271
You will meet Terry again someday.

00:16:20.421 --> 00:16:22.870
You need to learn to dress up.

00:16:25.284 --> 00:16:26.751
Terry...

00:16:27.286 --> 00:16:28.844
Candy!

00:16:29.555 --> 00:16:31.216
Mrs. Leagan!

00:16:31.824 --> 00:16:35.282
Candy, leave this house right away!

00:16:35.961 --> 00:16:37.486
You too, Annie.

00:16:37.636 --> 00:16:39.406
Why?

00:16:39.606 --> 00:16:43.626
Mother speaks for the entire family.

00:16:43.776 --> 00:16:45.566
Leave this house right now!

00:16:47.473 --> 00:16:50.766
Listen, this is not
the cottage in Lakewood.

00:16:50.916 --> 00:16:52.701
This is the Adleys' old house.

00:16:52.851 --> 00:16:54.204
Although you are the Adleys'
foster child,

00:16:54.354 --> 00:16:56.768
if people knew that an orphan of Pony's
Home is going in and out the house,

00:16:56.918 --> 00:16:59.715
how are the Adleys going to live
with that?

00:17:00.386 --> 00:17:04.782
Besides,
you are all orphans from Pony's Home.

00:17:04.932 --> 00:17:06.487
Hold on!

00:17:07.793 --> 00:17:11.627
Mrs. Leagan, they are our guests.

00:17:12.097 --> 00:17:15.553
Archie, you are a member of the Adleys.

00:17:15.703 --> 00:17:18.661
Do not take sides with the orphans
from Pony's Home.

00:17:18.811 --> 00:17:21.902
This has nothing to do with Aunt!

00:17:22.082 --> 00:17:24.902
Archie, you are being unreasonable.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:28.541
You hang out with these girls all day,
no wonder you are getting wild.

00:17:29.081 --> 00:17:31.507
Is this an order from Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:17:31.707 --> 00:17:34.310
Grand Aunt Elroy doesn't know about this.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:37.145
I do this for the good of the Adleys.

00:17:37.295 --> 00:17:39.019
- Neil.
- Yes!

00:17:40.059 --> 00:17:42.721
- Take out their luggage.
- Yes, Mother.

00:17:44.763 --> 00:17:46.924
Neil, if you dare...

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:48.666
Ouch! Mother!

00:17:48.801 --> 00:17:51.531
- Archie!
- Don't touch the luggage!

00:17:51.703 --> 00:17:53.502
Grand Aunt Elroy doesn't know about this?

00:17:53.772 --> 00:17:56.440
Ok, I'll talk to her.

00:17:57.209 --> 00:17:59.207
Stop it!

00:18:02.381 --> 00:18:05.438
No matter what,
Candy is the Adleys' foster child.

00:18:05.588 --> 00:18:08.574
The Leagans have no right to step in.

00:18:08.724 --> 00:18:09.441
Understand?

00:18:09.691 --> 00:18:12.654
What are you talking about?
I won't forgive you!

00:18:12.892 --> 00:18:15.021
Stear, forget it.

00:18:15.961 --> 00:18:19.823
Enough! I don't care the family
is famous or distinguished.

00:18:19.973 --> 00:18:21.657
I am not interested
in being a part of it.

00:18:21.801 --> 00:18:23.725
Of course.

00:18:24.403 --> 00:18:27.029
You are an orphan from Pony's Home.

00:18:28.607 --> 00:18:30.899
Let's get out of here.

00:18:31.049 --> 00:18:36.037
Stear, Archie,
let's move in the tree house.

00:18:36.582 --> 00:18:38.209
Can we, Annie?

00:18:39.151 --> 00:18:43.212
But how can we live
in such a small tree house?

00:18:43.822 --> 00:18:46.750
I would rather live in a tree house
than a beautiful house,

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:50.020
as long as we feel at ease
and welcomed.

00:18:52.097 --> 00:18:53.787
Ok, I understand.

00:18:53.937 --> 00:18:56.729
If you really want to do this, go ahead!

00:18:57.603 --> 00:18:59.070
Thank you.

00:18:59.505 --> 00:19:03.908
That tree house is ours.
Don't come to bother us anymore!

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:25.028
You've never lived in this kind of place.
Can't fall asleep?

00:19:25.998 --> 00:19:28.223
As long as we are together,
I don't care where we live.

00:19:28.373 --> 00:19:31.325
I have slept in many places.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:33.895
In hey, in the carriage....

00:19:37.009 --> 00:19:40.467
You've been through a lot, Candy.

00:19:41.313 --> 00:19:42.801
That day...

00:19:43.001 --> 00:19:46.879
The Christmas Eve with snow falling...

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:50.515
We were abandoned by our families,

00:19:50.956 --> 00:19:53.580
on the same day, in the same place.

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.119
We were adopted together.

00:19:55.928 --> 00:19:59.386
We grew up together.

00:19:59.698 --> 00:20:04.795
We walked towards different
directions in life until now.

00:20:06.471 --> 00:20:09.269
Good-bye, Annie!

00:20:10.742 --> 00:20:15.368
But you've been through a lot,
you're brave and strong.

00:20:15.518 --> 00:20:17.505
I can't compare to you.

00:20:17.849 --> 00:20:19.009
Candy...

00:20:19.918 --> 00:20:21.473
Don't ever leave me!

00:20:21.623 --> 00:20:26.552
What are you talking about?
We are sisters forever!

00:20:28.193 --> 00:20:30.252
- Candy...
- Annie...

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.700
Sister Pony and Sister Lane,
are they doing alright?

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.801
Candy, was there any change
in Pony's Home?

00:20:45.001 --> 00:20:46.669
It's the same as usual.

00:20:46.819 --> 00:20:48.705
- How about Kurin?
- He's fine too.

00:20:49.848 --> 00:20:53.615
I wish I could go back
to where I grew up.

00:20:57.623 --> 00:21:01.525
Candy and Annie forgot all their worries.

00:21:01.827 --> 00:21:05.786
They are immersed
in the memories from Pony's Home.
